Package: adaptation-samsung-r8q
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         linux-bootimage-samsung-r8q,
         adaptation-hybris-api30-phone,
         adaptation-samsung-r8q-configs,
Description: adaptation-samsung-r8q - meta
 Samsung Galaxy S20 FE 5G (SM-G781, codename r8q) adaptation metapackage.
 Depends on the kernel bootimage, the Halium API-30 phone runtime, and this
 device's adaptation configs.

Package: adaptation-samsung-r8q-configs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
Description: Samsung Galaxy S20 FE 5G (r8q) specific adaptation configs
 Device-specific configuration files (udev rules, phosh compositor settings,
 device flag files, hwcomposer/audio glue) for the Samsung Galaxy S20 FE 5G
 (r8q) running Droidian with Halium 11 / Android 11 (API 30).
